  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den Internationella Kommissionen mot Straffrihet iGuatemala, CICIG 2008-2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Commission against Impunity in  Guatemala, CICIG 2008-2012 - CICIG 2008-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CICIG; Guatemalas internationella kommission mot straffrihet, som     arbetar med att utreda brott, st&#xe4;rka &#xe5;klargarmydigheten och polisen.  St&#xf6;d via UNDP i en trust fund med 15 tal givare, som US, Spanien, EU, Japan, Tyskland och andra.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to make viable the establishment and functioning  of the International Commission Against Impunity in Guatemala (CICIG  for its abbreviation in Spanish) and to guarantee that the content of its Mandate is in accordance with its Creation Agreement.  The        Project centers on the promotion of institutional strengthening of    CICIG.</narrative>
  </description>
